<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαζ-ών</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰλ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span>, ὁ, ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλη</span>) prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wanderer about country, vagrant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>charlatan, quack</i>, esp. of Sophists, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				380
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				102
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				173c
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>braggart, boaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1127a21
			</span></i>; title of play by <i><span class="en">
				Men.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adj., <i>boastful, pretentious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					560c
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴρων</span>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴ ἀλαζονίστατον</span>
			<i>most shameless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				65c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα, δρω-ν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					4.29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
